---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — SpecGrid"
  description="Why SpecGrid exists and who built it — India's technical manufacturer directory, built from Coimbatore."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <article class="doc-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <!-- Technical Document Header -->
      <header class="doc-header">
        <div class="titleblock" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
          <div>Document<strong>DOC-REF // ABOUT-01</strong></div>
          <div>Origin<strong>Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu</strong></div>
          <div>Scope<strong>Technical Manufacturer Directory</strong></div>
          <div>Status<strong>Active</strong></div>
        </div>

        <div class="tag" style="margin-bottom: 14px;">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Directory Mission &amp; Background</span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="doc-title">About SpecGrid</h1>
        <p class="doc-lead">
          SpecGrid is a technical manufacturer directory for India, built to answer one question buyers keep struggling with: <em>who actually makes this, and to what spec?</em>
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Document Content Body -->
      <div class="doc-content">
        <section class="doc-section">
          <div class="section-tag mono">01 // Problem Statement</div>
          <h2>Why this exists</h2>
          <p>
            Most B2B directories in India are optimized for ad spend and lead volume, not accuracy. A buyer looking for a specific voltage class or certification has to call five suppliers to find one who actually matches — and the suppliers who do match often can't be found at all, because they don't outspend everyone else on listings.
          </p>
          <p>
            SpecGrid starts from the manufacturer's own public information — specs, certifications, what they actually build — and makes that searchable directly, without ad placement deciding who shows up first.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="doc-section">
          <div class="section-tag mono">02 // Industrial Cluster</div>
          <h2>Why Coimbatore</h2>
          <p>
            SpecGrid started with the Elektrotec exhibitor community in Coimbatore — one of India's densest clusters of switchgear, transformer, and industrial electrical manufacturers. It's growing outward from there, one verified category at a time.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="doc-section contact-panel">
          <div class="section-tag mono">03 // Communication Channel</div>
          <h2>Get in touch</h2>
          <p>
            Questions, corrections, or interested in claiming your profile:
          </p>
          <div style="margin-top: 14px;">
            <a href="mailto:mathi@specgrid.in" class="btn btn-primary">
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/>
                <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/>
              </svg>
              mathi@specgrid.in
            </a>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .doc-page {
    padding: 56px 0 72px;
  }

  .doc-header {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    padding-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .doc-title {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .doc-lead {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 680px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .doc-lead em {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .doc-content {
    max-width: 720px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 36px;
  }

  .doc-section {
    position: relative;
  }

  .section-tag {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--green);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .doc-section h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .doc-section p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .doc-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .contact-panel {
    border: 1px solid var(--paper-line);
    background: var(--card);
    padding: 24px 28px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
</style>
